        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    contracts = 5\n    shares_per_contract = 100\n    premium_received = 2.50\n    strike_price = 150\n    market_price = 158\n    shares_bought_price = 140\n\n    # Calculate the covered call profit\n    shares = contracts * shares_per_contract\n    total_premium = premium_received * shares\n    stock_profit = (min(market_price, strike_price) - shares_bought_price) * shares\n    answer = round(total_premium + stock_profit)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
